      "content": "i know people say it's a \"narrative\" but it doesn't feel like that. it feels more like a math equation. if i keep going, the suffering just keeps multiplying. it's like i'm just an extra piece of fuel for the fire. wouldn't it be more \"noble\" to just cut the line there? to make sure the cycle actually ends instead of just pretending i can change something that's been happening for a hundred years?",
